  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.01 Administrative costs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.01 “Administrative costs” means expenses associated with managing DWSRF projects. The term includes but is not limited to costs for engineering and other consultants, environmental and technical reviews of proposed projects, participation in state overview inspections, and accounting and disbursement functions.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
